                <invention-title lang="de">CLOUD-BASIERTE CROSS-DOMAIN-SYSTEM - VIRTUELLE DATENDIODE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME INTER-DOMAINE BASÉ SUR LE NUAGE - DIODE DE DONNÉES VIRTUELLES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">CLOUD BASED CROSS DOMAIN SYSTEM - VIRTUAL DATA DIODE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>In some aspects, a computer-implemented method comprises: receiving, by a computing device of a virtual cloud network, a first message in a data pipeline from a network interface card (NIC); determining, by the computing device of the virtual cloud network, a first sequential order for a first set of filters in the data pipeline, wherein the determined first sequential order is determined based at least in part on a source of the first message; and determining, by the computing device of the virtual cloud network, a first filtering decision for the first message in the data pipeline by passing the first message through the first set of filters in the determined first sequential order Numerous other aspects are described.</p>
            </abstract>
